  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1
    m_Localized: 火焰喷射器
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2
    m_Localized: 喷射火焰并造成持续伤害。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3
    m_Localized: 病毒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5
    m_Localized: 危险废料
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7
    m_Localized: 锯齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8
    m_Localized: 对这节车厢周围的敌人造成伤害。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9
    m_Localized: 冲锋枪无人机
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10
    m_Localized: 冲锋枪无人机攻速快、射程中，但伤害低。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11
    m_Localized: 闪电武器
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12
    m_Localized: 随机攻击数名远距离敌人。并连锁攻击其附近敌人。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13
    m_Localized: 水晶
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15
    m_Localized: 火焰配件
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17
    m_Localized: 铀
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19
    m_Localized: 金条
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20
    m_Localized: 每到一站，此模块<color=#FFEB87>售价</color>提升 <color=#71FF90>{0}</color>。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: -2
  - m_Id: 21
    m_Localized: 寒冰喷射器
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22
    m_Localized: 喷射冷气，降低敌人移动速度。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23
    m_Localized: 寒冰配件
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25
    m_Localized: 霰弹枪无人机
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26
    m_Localized: 霰弹枪无人机近距离伤害高、攻击范围广，但攻速低。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27
    m_Localized: 击退配件
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29
    m_Localized: 霰弹枪炮塔
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30
    m_Localized: 在这节车厢安装一把霰弹枪。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31
    m_Localized: 一袋金币
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32
    m_Localized: 将其运送至下一站，并获得 300 金币。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33
    m_Localized: 雷达
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35
    m_Localized: 步枪炮塔
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36
    m_Localized: 在这节车厢安装一把步枪。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37
    m_Localized: 镭射炮塔
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38
    m_Localized: 在这节车厢安装一把能造成大量伤害的镭射武器。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39
    m_Localized: 钚
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41
    m_Localized: 穿刺器
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43
    m_Localized: 快速合并
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44
    m_Localized: 运送至下一战后，合并这节车厢所需波次 <color=#71FF90>-1</color>。（最低为 1）
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45
    m_Localized: 吉他音箱
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46
    m_Localized: 在列车受到攻击时，将敌人击退。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
